B.aaS=new A.ev("Not yet validated on patients. The weights are taken from published studies but the combined model has not been tested against video-EEG-confirmed diagnoses.",!1,null)
B.aaU=new A.ev("Naive Bayes assumes findings are independent. They are not; damping reduces but does not remove overconfidence, so treat high percentages with caution.",!1,null)
B.aaP=new A.ev("Decision support only. It does not replace clinical judgement, a specialist opinion or video-EEG.",!1,null)
B.aaI=new A.ev("The output depends entirely on the quality of the witness account and the features you select.",!1,null)
B.aaV=new A.ev("Epileptic seizures and PNES can coexist; the tool cannot detect dual diagnosis.",!1,null)
B.aaW=new A.ev("Localization uses aura and semiology only. Rapid spread and non-localizing semiology can point to the wrong lobe.",!1,null)
B.aaQ=new A.ev("Not a regulated medical device.",!0,null)
