B.Go=new A.cn("Localization","Choking sensation & dysautonomia","Painful unilateral paresthesia with dysautonomia and a choking sensation should raise suspicion for insular onset.",B.ck)
B.Gf=new A.cn("Localization","MRI-negative frontal epilepsy","Frontal lobe seizures are frequently MRI-negative even when focal cortical dysplasia is the underlying cause.",B.ep)
B.Gj=new A.cn("Syndromes","Gelastic seizures","Suggest a hypothalamic hamartoma, especially with precocious puberty in a child.",B.cS)
B.G6=new A.cn("Syndromes","Early-morning myoclonus","Ask every adolescent with early-morning myoclonic jerks about juvenile myoclonic epilepsy before labeling episodes as clumsiness.",B.cS)
B.G3=new A.cn("Syndromes","Infantile spasms","With developmental regression, a pediatric neurologic emergency requiring urgent EEG (hypsarrhythmia) and treatment.",B.cS)
B.G7=new A.cn("Syndromes","Catamenial pattern","Best confirmed with a seizure diary correlated against a menstrual calendar, not by history alone.",B.ep)
B.Ga=new A.cn("Syndromes","Reflex epilepsy triggers","Photosensitive, reading, musicogenic, hot water and startle epilepsies share a stereotyped trigger-to-seizure relationship \u2014 ask specifically.",B.ck)
B.Gi=new A.cn("Mimics","Convulsive syncope","The single most commonly misdiagnosed seizure mimic in adults \u2014 look for a presyncopal prodrome and rapid full recovery.",B.cS)
B.G5=new A.cn("Mimics","Anoxic myoclonus","Brief myoclonic jerks during a faint do not make an event epileptic.",B.ck)
B.G8=new A.cn("Mimics","Bedside glucose","Always check during the acute evaluation of any transient event \u2014 hypoglycemia is a readily reversible mimic.",B.ep)
B.Gd=new A.cn("Mimics","Migraine aura tempo","Migraine with aura evolves more slowly (minutes) than an epileptic aura (seconds) and is usually followed by headache.",B.ck)
B.Gk=new A.cn("Investigations","Normal EEG \u2260 no epilepsy","A single normal interictal EEG does not exclude epilepsy \u2014 sensitivity rises with sleep-deprived and repeated recordings.",B.ep)
B.Gb=new A.cn("Investigations","Video-EEG monitoring","Capturing a typical habitual event remains the diagnostic gold standard when the differential is unclear.",B.ep)
B.G2=new A.cn("Investigations","CK & lactate rise","Elevated CK and a transient venous lactate rise support a recent convulsive epileptic seizure.",B.ck)
